## 6. Related work / boundary  *[PENDING — short, PLAN §1]*

On-policy distillation and KL distillation (standard). Active data selection /
core-set / uncertainty sampling for fine-tuning (entropy routing is the
baseline we beat-or-tie). Diffusion-style counterfactual value estimation is
*not* claimed — our τ is a single-step difference-in-rewards over a placebo,
specific to one distillation update. What is **not** claimed: superiority over a
full RLHF or rejection-sampling pipeline at unlimited budget; the claim is
strictly about *where to spend a fixed teacher budget* in on-policy
distillation, and that τ-based routing is neither entropy-in-disguise nor
reducible to cheap features.

