## 7. Limitations  *[PENDING]*

- k = 4 quantization of τ during calibration (coarse); larger k sharpens τ at
  calibration cost.
- Oracle-arm per-iteration τ drift (student changes each iter; frozen oracle-τ
  is an approximation).
- Single 48 GB card → model pair and train_n are modest; the method is
  compute-bounded not method-bounded.
- One domain (math). Generalization to code/verifiable domains is future work.

